\n    [#D7D7AF]launch-time sase repo path substitution; update docs, add a regression [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test, and note the general launch-time cwd hazard.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Flag writes the commit finalizer cannot see[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]unscanned-write-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]unscanned-write-guard: add a shared detector for run writes and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registered artifact sources that sit in checkouts the commit finalizer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]does not scan, and surface it in sase final context, sase artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create, and the /sase_final and /sase_repo skills.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recover stranded research reports from apollo[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]stray-report-recovery[dim] · [dim][/dim]after research-macro-paths[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stray-report-recovery: copy the untracked reports from apollo's primary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]research checkouts into opened clones so the host commits them, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]handle the originals per the recovery decision.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1tj","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1tj.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-dbb0b9e7b95a1d7b797b181242c54006","started_at":"2026-11-18T16:50:31.387209+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"00c4881045c326ddccb6da4b7fa63aac457f595b7fa0eb6531a8f5c9aaf4775e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1tj.3/commits.json","size_bytes